{"audio": "galatians-06.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 117733, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1733, "text": "Galatians, Chapter Six."}, {"start_ms": 1733, "end_ms": 11867, "text": "Brethren, if a man be overtaken in a fault, ye which are spiritual, restore such an one in the spirit of meekness; considering thyself, lest thou also be tempted."}, {"start_ms": 11867, "end_ms": 15867, "text": "Bear ye one another's burdens, and so fulfil the law of Christ."}, {"start_ms": 15867, "end_ms": 20933, "text": "For if a man think himself to be something, when he is nothing, he deceiveth himself."}, {"start_ms": 20933, "end_ms": 28267, "text": "But let every man prove his own work, and then shall he have rejoicing in himself alone, and not in another."}, {"start_ms": 28267, "end_ms": 30933, "text": "For every man shall bear his own burden."}, {"start_ms": 30933, "end_ms": 35867, "text": "Let him that is taught in the word communicate unto him that teacheth in all good things."}, {"start_ms": 35867, "end_ms": 43067, "text": "Be not deceived; God is not mocked: for whatsoever a man soweth, that shall he also reap."}, {"start_ms": 43067, "end_ms": 51867, "text": "For he that soweth to his flesh shall of the flesh reap corruption; but he that soweth to the Spirit shall of the Spirit reap life everlasting."}, {"start_ms": 51867, "end_ms": 57867, "text": "And let us not be weary in well doing: for in due season we shall reap, if we faint not."}, {"start_ms": 57867, "end_ms": 64667, "text": "As we have therefore opportunity, let us do good unto all men, especially unto them who are of the household of faith."}, {"start_ms": 64667, "end_ms": 68800, "text": "Ye see how large a letter I have written unto you with mine own hand."}, {"start_ms": 68800, "end_ms": 77733, "text": "As many as desire to make a fair shew in the flesh, they constrain you to be circumcised; only lest they should suffer persecution for the cross of Christ."}, {"start_ms": 77733, "end_ms": 85467, "text": "For neither they themselves who are circumcised keep the law; but desire to have you circumcised, that they may glory in your flesh."}, {"start_ms": 85467, "end_ms": 94933, "text": "But God forbid that I should glory, save in the cross of our Lord Jesus Christ, by whom the world is crucified unto me, and I unto the world."}, {"start_ms": 94933, "end_ms": 101333, "text": "For in Christ Jesus neither circumcision availeth any thing, nor uncircumcision, but a new creature."}, {"start_ms": 101333, "end_ms": 107200, "text": "And as many as walk according to this rule, peace be on them, and mercy, and upon the Israel of God."}, {"start_ms": 107200, "end_ms": 112800, "text": "From henceforth let no man trouble me: for I bear in my body the marks of the Lord Jesus."}, {"start_ms": 112800, "end_ms": 116933, "text": "Brethren, the grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit."}, {"start_ms": 116933, "end_ms": 117733, "text": "Amen."}], "words": [{"t": "Galatians,", "s": 60, "e": 685, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 927, "e": 1270, "si": 0}, {"t": "Six.", "s": 1350, "e": 1572, "si": 0}, {"t": "Brethren,", "s": 1853, "e": 2194, "si": 1}, {"t": "if", "s": 2574, "e": 2654, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 2714, "e": 2734, "si": 1}, {"t": "man", "s": 2794, "e": 3015, "si": 1}, {"t": "be", "s": 3075, "e": 3135, "si": 1}, {"t": "overtaken", "s": 3215, "e": 3716, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 3756, "e": 3836, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 3856, "e": 3876, "si": 1}, {"t": "fault,", "s": 3976, "e": 4337, "si": 1}, {"t": "ye", "s": 4657, "e": 4737, "si": 1}, {"t": "which", "s": 4797, "e": 4977, "si": 1}, {"t": "are", "s": 5018, "e": 5138, "si": 1}, {"t": "spiritual,", "s": 5178, "e": 5698, "si": 1}, {"t": "restore", "s": 6199, "e": 6620, "si": 1}, {"t": "such", "s": 6720, "e": 6940, "si": 1}, {"t": "an", "s": 6980, "e": 7040, "si": 1}, {"t": "one", "s": 7140, "e": 7261, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 7281, "e": 7341, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 7361, "e": 7441, "si": 1}, {"t": "spirit", "s"